# Powers the ALERT <GO> command in the terminal command line (components/command-line.tsx).
# When a visitor "subscribes" via ALERT, their email is POSTed here as JSON: { email, message }.
#
# Setup (Formspree, free tier):
#   1. Go to https://formspree.io and create a free account.
#   2. Create a new form and copy its endpoint, e.g. https://formspree.io/f/xxxxabcd
#   3. Copy this file to .env.local and paste the endpoint below.
#   4. Restart the dev server (`npm run dev`) so Next.js picks up the new env var.
#
# Without this set, ALERT <GO> shows a friendly "not configured yet" message instead of failing silently.
NEXT_PUBLIC_ALERT_FORM_ENDPOINT=
